@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
title Exporting all contacts to CSV: successful execution

participant ":LogicManager" as LogicManager LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ExportCommand" as ExportCommand LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":Model" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant ":ReadOnlyAddressBook" as AddressBook MODEL_COLOR
participant ":CsvContactExporter" as Exporter STORAGE_COLOR

[-> LogicManager : execute("export --csv")
activate LogicManager
ref over LogicManager, ExportCommand
AddressBookParser and ExportCommandParser
create ExportCommand("contacts.csv").
end ref

LogicManager -> ExportCommand : execute(model)
activate ExportCommand
ExportCommand -> Model : getAddressBook()
activate Model
Model --> ExportCommand : addressBook
deactivate Model
ExportCommand -> AddressBook : getPersonList()
activate AddressBook
AddressBook --> ExportCommand : all stored contacts
deactivate AddressBook
note over ExportCommand, AddressBook
Take a List.copyOf snapshot, independent of the filter.
Assume contacts are nonempty and the file can be created.
end note

ExportCommand -> Exporter : export(contacts, "contacts.csv")
activate Exporter
note over Exporter
Reject an existing destination.
Create a temporary file in the output directory.
end note
Exporter -> Exporter : writeContacts(writer, contacts)
activate Exporter
note over Exporter
Write UTF-8 header and escaped rows.
Missing details become empty cells.
end note
Exporter --> Exporter
deactivate Exporter
note over Exporter
Close the writer and move the temporary file
without replacing an existing destination.
Clean up the temporary file in finally.
end note
Exporter --> ExportCommand : export completed
deactivate Exporter
ExportCommand --> LogicManager : result: CommandResult(count and filename)
deactivate ExportCommand

LogicManager -> ExportCommand : requiresStorageSave()
activate ExportCommand
ExportCommand --> LogicManager : false
deactivate ExportCommand
note over LogicManager
Return immediately: no JSON storage save.
The model and displayed filter are unchanged.
end note
[<-- LogicManager : result
deactivate LogicManager
@enduml
